{"name": "Date Calculator", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Date Calculator — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>Date Calculator</title>\n<style>\n:root{--build-id:\"cbff539a7d\";\n  color-scheme:light dark;\n  --bg:var(--myllm-bg,#f2f2f7);--surface:var(--myllm-surface,#fff);\n  --text:var(--myllm-text,#111);--muted:var(--myllm-muted,#6b6b72);\n  --accent:var(--myllm-accent,#0b5ed7);--border:var(--myllm-border,rgba(120,120,128,.25));\n  --radius:var(--myllm-radius,14px);--font:var(--myllm-font,-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif);\n}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:var(--myllm-bg,#000);--surface:var(--myllm-surface,#1c1c1e);--text:var(--myllm-text,#eee);--muted:var(--myllm-muted,#98989f)}}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:var(--font);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}\n.wrap{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px}\n.seg{display:flex;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:3px;margin-bottom:18px}\n.seg button{flex:1;border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:10px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer}\n.seg button.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\nlabel{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;margin:0 0 6px}\n.field{margin-bottom:16px}\ninput[type=date]{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text)}\n.opseg{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px}\n.opseg button{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border-radius:11px;padding:12px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}\n.opseg button.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}\n.amts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px}\n.amt label{margin-bottom:4px}\n.amt input{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;font:inherit;font-size:17px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);text-align:center}\n.today{background:none;border:0;color:var(--accent);font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 0}\n.result{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;text-align:center;margin-top:4px}\n.result .big{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2}\n.result .sub{font-size:14px;opacity:.9;margin-top:6px}\n.result.alt{background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border)}\n.result.alt .big{color:var(--accent)}\n.rowdates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"seg\"><button id=\"tabAdd\" class=\"on\">Add / Subtract</button><button id=\"tabDiff\">Difference</button></div>\n\n  <div id=\"addView\">\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Start date</label><input type=\"date\" id=\"start\"><button class=\"today\" data-for=\"start\">Today</button></div>\n    <div class=\"opseg\"><button id=\"opAdd\" class=\"on\">＋ Add</button><button id=\"opSub\">－ Subtract</button></div>\n    <div class=\"amts\">\n      <div class=\"amt\"><label>Years</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"y\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"></div>\n      <div class=\"amt\"><label>Months</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"mo\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"></div>\n      <div class=\"amt\"><label>Weeks</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"w\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"></div>\n      <div class=\"amt\"><label>Days</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"da\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"result\" id=\"addResult\"><div class=\"big\">—</div><div class=\"sub\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"diffView\" style=\"display:none\">\n    <div class=\"rowdates\">\n      <div class=\"field\"><label>From</label><input type=\"date\" id=\"from\"><button class=\"today\" data-for=\"from\">Today</button></div>\n      <div class=\"field\"><label>To</label><input type=\"date\" id=\"to\"><button class=\"today\" data-for=\"to\">Today</button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"result alt\" id=\"diffResult\"><div class=\"big\">—</div><div class=\"sub\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"result alt\" id=\"diffTotals\" style=\"margin-top:10px;padding:13px\"><div class=\"sub\" style=\"opacity:1\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"hint\">Months and years are calendar-aware: adding a month lands on the same day next month (clamped to the last day for short months). Difference shows the gap in calendar years, months and days.</p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nvar op=1; // +1 add, -1 subtract\nfunction $(i){return document.getElementById(i)}\nfunction haptic(k){if(window.myllmHaptic)try{myllmHaptic(k)}catch(e){}}\nfunction todayStr(){var d=new Date();return d.getFullYear()+'-'+pad(d.getMonth()+1)+'-'+pad(d.getDate())}\nfunction pad(n){return (n<10?'0':'')+n}\nfunction parse(v){if(!v)return null;var p=v.split('-');return new Date(+p[0],+p[1]-1,+p[2],12,0,0)}\nfunction fmt(d){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat([],{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric'}).format(d)}\nfunction num(id){var n=parseInt($(id).value);return isNaN(n)||n<0?0:n}\n\nfunction calcAdd(){\n  var s=parse($('start').value);if(!s){$('addResult').querySelector('.big').textContent='Pick a start date';$('addResult').querySelector('.sub').textContent='';return}\n  var y=num('y'),mo=num('mo'),w=num('w'),da=num('da');\n  var Y=s.getFullYear()+op*y, M=s.getMonth()+op*mo;\n  var d=new Date(Y,M,1,12);\n  var last=new Date(d.getFullYear(),d.getMonth()+1,0).getDate();\n  d.setDate(Math.min(s.getDate(),last));\n  d.setDate(d.getDate()+op*(w*7+da));\n  var totalDays=Math.round((d-s)/86400000);\n  $('addResult').querySelector('.big').textContent=fmt(d);\n  var rel=totalDays===0?'same day':(Math.abs(totalDays)+' day'+(Math.abs(totalDays)===1?'':'s')+(totalDays>0?' later':' earlier'));\n  $('addResult').querySelector('.sub').textContent=rel;\n}\n\nfunction calcDiff(){\n  var a=parse($('from').value),b=parse($('to').value);\n  var R=$('diffResult'),T=$('diffTotals');\n  if(!a||!b){R.querySelector('.big').textContent='Pick both dates';R.querySelector('.sub').textContent='';T.querySelector('.sub').textContent='';return}\n  var sign=a<=b?1:-1, A=sign>0?a:b, B=sign>0?b:a;\n  var y=B.getFullYear()-A.getFullYear(), m=B.getMonth()-A.getMonth(), d=B.getDate()-A.getDate();\n  if(d<0){m--;d+=new Date(B.getFullYear(),B.getMonth(),0).getDate()}\n  if(m<0){y--;m+=12}\n  var parts=[];if(y)parts.push(y+' year'+(y===1?'':'s'));if(m)parts.push(m+' month'+(m===1?'':'s'));if(d)parts.push(d+' day'+(d===1?'':'s'));\n  var total=Math.round((B-A)/86400000);\n  R.querySelector('.big').textContent= total===0?'Same day':parts.join(', ');\n  R.querySelector('.sub').textContent= total===0?'':(sign<0?'(From is after To)':'');\n  var wk=Math.floor(total/7),rem=total%7;\n  T.querySelector('.sub').innerHTML='<b style=\"color:var(--accent)\">'+total.toLocaleString()+'</b> total days &nbsp;·&nbsp; '+wk+' week'+(wk===1?'':'s')+(rem?(' '+rem+'d'):'');\n}\n\n$('tabAdd').onclick=function(){sw(true)};\n$('tabDiff').onclick=function(){sw(false)};\nfunction sw(add){\n  $('tabAdd').classList.toggle('on',add);$('tabDiff').classList.toggle('on',!add);\n  $('addView').style.display=add?'block':'none';$('diffView').style.display=add?'none':'block';haptic('selection');\n}\n$('opAdd').onclick=function(){op=1;$('opAdd').classList.add('on');$('opSub').classList.remove('on');calcAdd();haptic('selection')};\n$('opSub').onclick=function(){op=-1;$('opSub').classList.add('on');$('opAdd').classList.remove('on');calcAdd();haptic('selection')};\n\n['start','y','mo','w','da'].forEach(function(id){$(id).addEventListener('input',calcAdd)});\n['from','to'].forEach(function(id){$(id).addEventListener('input',calcDiff)});\nArray.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll('.today'),function(b){b.onclick=function(){$(b.getAttribute('data-for')).value=todayStr();haptic('selection');calcAdd();calcDiff()}});\n\n// init\n$('start').value=todayStr();$('from').value=todayStr();$('to').value=todayStr();\ncalcAdd();calcDiff();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "kind": "html", "iconSymbol": "calendar.badge.plus", "iconColor": "orange"}